  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Oldenborn (Earthbound)</em> at level 11; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“The mountain does not fall. It negotiates.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Mountain Stance (PB/Long Rest).</strong> As a bonus action, you enter a stance for 1 minute. While in the stance, you have advantage on Strength checks and Strength saving throws, and creatures provoke opportunity attacks from you even when they Disengage (because you make the ground your ally).</p>",
